<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-AUSTRALIAN P-NOTES - One tender of A$20 mln.</title>
<headline>RTRS-AUSTRALIAN P-NOTES - One tender of A$20 mln.</headline>
<dateline>MELBOURNE 1996-08-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Australian commercial paper market started this week as it finished the last, with MLC Building Society the only issuer.</p>
<p>MLC sold A$20 million of its September 25-dated paper at 7.01 percent or two basis points over the mid-rate for 30-day bank bills.</p>
<p>Friday's weakening in the U.S. debt market has prompted a slight sell-down in short end physical yields over the morning.</p>
<p>Discount securities dealers said turnover was slow with interest focussed on paper maturing in thirty days or less.</p>
